" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">None</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mallick <italic>et al.</italic>, 2006 <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b39-co16-2-16">39</xref></td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Prospective</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">To test the hypothesis that palliative <sc>ebb</sc> treatment with or without <sc>xrt</sc> can reduce endobronchial symptoms for a prolonged period and also improve <sc>qol</sc></td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">A: 30 Gy/10 fr with <sc>ebb</sc> on days 6 and 13: 8Gy/1fr<break/>B: 30 Gy/10 fr with <sc>ebb</sc> on day 13: 10 Gy/1 fr<break/>C: <sc>ebb</sc> 15 Gy/1 fr</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">95</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">A: 10 months<break/>B: 10 months<break/>C: 10 months</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><sc>eortc qlq</sc>-C30<break/><sc>eortc qlq</sc>-LC13</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><sc>kps</sc></td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">None</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">2</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Mallick <italic>et al.</italic>, 2007 <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b40-co16-2-16">40</xref></td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Prospective</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">To compare the subjective and objective responses to 3 regimens for duration, <sc>qol</sc> outcomes, and complications</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">A: 30 Gy/10 fr with <sc>ebb</sc> on days 6 and 13: 8 Gy/1 fr<break/>B: 30 Gy/10 fr with <sc>ebb</sc> on day 13: 10 Gy/1 fr<break/>C: <sc>ebb</sc> 15 Gy/1 fr</td><td align="center" valign="top" rowspan="1" colspan="1">45</td><td align="center" valign="top